+## Local Android sandbox compatibility patch (1.6.1)
+
+This copy replaces raw filesystem calls with Gen1Recomp's sandbox-safe `mod:read()` API and keeps the bundled player-sprite chooser working without directory enumeration. It is an unofficial compatibility patch based on v1.6.
